[en.FOCUS_C18_101_CIVIL_INDUSTRY]
Drive-Thru Factory

[en.FOCUS_C18_101_CIVIL_INDUSTRY_desc]
In the western coastal area of the Kirin commune, there is the only main railway line: along this railway line, the train will go northward, passing through the dragon territory, through caves and portals, and finally reaching the central Equestria continent.\nPreviously, this railway line was in disrepair for many years, to an extenet that only one pony was on duty at the last station. But now, we will take advantage of this railway line and build a large-scale light industrial park along the railway. Let our small commodities with the characteristic Kirin culture go directly from the factory assembly line to the market in Equestria. Let the rich merchants of Las Pegasus and Ponyville empty their wallets for our tea, porcelain, cloth, and furniture.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_101_CIVIL_INDUSTRY]
呼啸工厂

[zh.FOCUS_C18_101_CIVIL_INDUSTRY_desc]
在麒麟社群的西部沿海，有着麒麟社群唯一一条主干铁路线：沿着这条铁路一路向北，列车将穿越龙族的领地，穿过山洞与传送门，抵达小马利亚中央大陆。\n此前，这条铁路线年久失修，甚至在最后一站只有一只小马在值班。但如今，我们将利用这条铁路的优势，沿着铁路建设大规模轻工业园区。让带有麒麟族特色文化的小商品，从工厂流水线直达小马利亚的市场。让洛马基与小马谷的富商们，为我们的茶叶、瓷器、布匹、家具掏空他们的钱包。

